    <string name="settings_privacy_body">REPLATE keeps the details you give it: your name, phone number, email and pickup address, your orders and reviews, and your chat messages with hotels.

Your live location is used only while the app is open, to show nearby hotels, and is not stored. If you choose a pickup address, its map position is saved to your profile.

Orders, reviews and chats are shared with the hotel you order from. A notification token lets us send you order updates, and anonymous crash and usage reports help us fix problems.

You can delete your account and its data from your profile at any time.</string>
